#: ../../../steps.md:3
msgid "Steps"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../steps.md:5
msgid ""
"The `steps` directive lays out a numbered, visually connected procedure — "
"useful for install guides, tutorials and any ordered \"do this, then this\" "
"content. Each `step` is numbered automatically, so inserting, removing or re-"
"ordering steps never means renumbering by hand."
msgstr ""

