#: ../../../steps.md:64
msgid "Numbering offset"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../steps.md:66
msgid ""
"Use the `start` option on `steps` to begin the numbering at a value other "
"than `1`, for example when a procedure is split across sections. Both the "
"visible markers and the ordered-list semantics start from that value."
msgstr ""

