msgid "Colours"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../steps.md:84
msgid ""
"By default the markers use the `primary` semantic colour, so they retint "
"automatically with your theme. Use the `color` option to pick another "
"semantic colour — one of `primary`, `secondary`, `success`, `info`, "
"`warning`, `danger`, `light`, `muted`, `dark`, `white` or `black`."
msgstr ""

